OL,3,GNEWSAFurther charge after officer shot
OL,4,Ain city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA further suspect has been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with the shooting of a
OL,8,Fpolice officer in Nottingham city
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FPC Lee Lane was shot in the foot after
OL,12,Fapproaching two suspects at a bus stop
OL,13,Fin Angel Row shortly before 04:50 BST
OL,14,Fon 18 October.
OL,16,FMischelle Chaplin, 33, of Aspley, has
OL,17,Fbeen charged with possessing a
OL,18,Fprohibited firearm and has been bailed.
OL,20,FShe is due to appear at Nottingham
OL,21,FMagistrates Court on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
